OL,3,GNEWSAFacing the future without the
OL,4,A'bank of mum and dad'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister used the plight of
OL,7,Fyoung people unable to rely on the
OL,8,F"bank of mum and dad" as a
OL,9,Fcurtain-raiser for Labour's annual
OL,10,Fconference.
OL,12,FThe Your First Home scheme will offer a
OL,13,Fgovernment-backed loan of 20% of the
OL,14,Fpurchase price - with a minimum deposit
OL,15,Fof 2.5%.
OL,17,FBut how tough are things at the moment
OL,18,Ffor young people who have left school
OL,19,Fand want to make their way in the
OL,20,Fworld?
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
