OL,3,GNEWSAFacing the future without the
OL,4,A'bank of mum and dad'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChari, 19, from Hertfordshire, spent
OL,7,Fsome of her childhood in care but has
OL,8,Fjust started at university and has
OL,9,Fambitions to qualify as a doctor of
OL,10,Fpsychology.
